OL,3,AProtesters disrupt Sir Paul Smith's    
OL,4,Abook talk                              
OL,6,FFashion firm Paul Smith has told the   
OL,7,FBBC it is committed to animal welfare  
OL,8,Fafter protesters disrupted a talk by   
OL,9,Fthe brand's founder in his home city.  
OL,11,FTwo supporters of People for the       
OL,12,FEthical Treatment of Animals (PETA)    
OL,13,Finterrupted the event hosted by Sir    
OL,14,FPaul Smith at Nottingham's Broadway    
OL,15,FCinema on Wednesday.                   
OL,17,FThe protest follows investigations by  
OL,18,FPETA into alleged animal cruelty at    
OL,19,Fmohair production facilities in South  
OL,20,FAfrica and Lesotho, including one it   
OL,21,Fsaid had links to a Paul Smith         
OL,22,Fsupplier.                              
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
